    'Automated cell segmentation software to detect protein localization patterns in differently stained fluorescence microscopy images using computer vision (Patterning Protein Localisation in Endothelial Cells, research project with Prof. Syamantak Majumder). Protein localization — where in a cell a protein concentrates — is a key indicator of cellular health and function in biomedical research.',
