(
    'Designed and implemented supporting ADTs in C: SET ADT for FIRST/FOLLOW sets, Stack ADT for parsing, Parse Tree ADT, and file reader for grammar specification. Built with Makefile; all 6 test programs successfully lexed/tokenized, 4 successfully parsed (CS F363 Compiler Construction, BITS Pilani, 2024). Team of 6: Aryaman Chauhan, Devansh, Arnav Gujarathi, Akshaj Dixit, Tanushi Garg, Avyakt Garg.',
