(
    'Avyakt Garg — MS CS student at University of Wisconsin-Madison (GPA 4.0) and ex-Uber Software Intern. Background spans distributed systems engineering (Kafka, gRPC, SpringBoot at Uber) and machine learning research (graph neural networks, medical imaging, IoT). Originally from New Delhi, India; BITS Pilani dual-degree graduate (CS + Biological Sciences, GPA 9.01/10). MITACS Globalink Scholar. Currently in Madison, Wisconsin, targeting software engineering and ML engineering roles at top-tier tech companies.',
    'personal_bio',
    'personal',
